<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">phm --- Māori NT converted from rtf (LAI); 20100830 zb</book>
  <para style="h">PIRIMONA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Pukapuka a Paora Āpōtoro ki a</para>
  <para style="mt1">PIRIMONA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kupu Whakataki</para>
  <para style="im">He Karaiti­ana whaka­rae a Pirimona, tērā pea he whaka­mine­nga nō te hāhi i Korohe, te ranga­tira o te tau­reka­reka a Onehimu. I oma te tau­reka­reka nei mai i tāna ranga­tira, ā, nā te aha noa iho ka tūpono ki a Paora, i roto i te whare here­here i taua wā. Nā Paora, ka Karaiti­ana a Onehimu. <char style="bk">Ko te Puka­puka a Paora Āpōtoro ki a Pirimona</char> e īnoi ana ki a Pirimona kia noho rata ki tana tau­reka­reka, e whaka­hokia atu ana e Paora ki a ia, me te pōwhiri i a ia, kaua he tau­reka­reka anake, i murua nei, engari, he teina Karaiti­ana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Rāpopoto o Ngā Take</para>
  <para style="io1">Tīmatanga 1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Whakanui i a Pirimona 4-7</para>
  <para style="io1">Te īnoi mō Onehimu 8-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Whakamutunga 23-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s1">He Mihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nā Paora, nā te here­here a Karaiti Īhu, nā tō tāua teina hoki, nā Tīmoti –</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ki tā māua e aroha nei ki tō māua hoa mahi, ki a Pirimona, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ki a Apia hoki, ki tō māua tua­hine, ki tō māua hoa hōia, ki a Arakipu, ki te hāhi hoki i tōu whare:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Kia tau te aroha noa ki a koutou, me te rangi­mārie, he mea nā te Atua, nā tō tātou Matua, nā te Ariki hoki, nā Īhu Karaiti.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Te Aroha me te Whakapono o Pirimona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Tēnei ahau te whaka­whetai atu nei ki tōku Atua, mau tonu tōku mahara ki a koe i āku karakia­tanga. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />He rongo nōku ki tōu aroha, ki tōu whaka­pono ki te Ariki, ki a Īhu, ā, ki te hunga tapu katoa. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Mō te whaka­hoa­tanga mai o tōu whaka­pono kia whai mana, i runga i te mātau­ranga ki ngā pai katoa i roto i a koutou, he mea ki a Karaiti Īhu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />He nui hoki tō mātou koa, mārie ana hoki te ngākau i tōu aroha, nō te mea e ora ana ngā ngākau o te hunga tapu i a koe, e tōku teina.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">He Tono mō Onehimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Heoi, ahakoa he nui tōku māia i roto i a te Karaiti ki te whaka­takoto atu i te mea tika ki a koe. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Nā te aroha kē tāku ka īnoi atu nei, arā tāku, tā te koro­heke, tā Paora, he here­here nei ināia­nei nā Īhu Karaiti. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />He kupu tēnei nāku ki a koe mō tāku tama­iti, mō Onehimu, he mea whānau nāku i ahau nei i te here­here. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />I mua, kāhore tētahi mea pai ana ki a koe; ināia­nei ia, kua whai pai koe i a ia, ahau anō hoki.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Kua whaka­hokia atu nei ia e ahau, tōna tinana tonu, ko tōku manawa ake ia. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />I mea anō ahau kia puri­tia ia ki ahau, hei whaka­kapi mōu ki te mahi ki ahau i roto i ngā meka­meka o te rongo­pai. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Otirā, kāhore nei tāu kupu, kīhai ahau i pai kia meatia tētahi mea; kei riro whaka­uaua mai tōu pai; engari i roto anō i te ngākau.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ko te mea anō pea tēnei i motu­hia mai ai ia i a koe mō tētahi wā, kia mau pū ai ia i a koe ake ake. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ehara i te mea hei pono­nga ia i ēnei wā, engari tērā atu i te pono­nga, he teina i nui rawa ai tōku aroha, tērā ia e nui rawa atu tōu, i te kiko­kiko, i te Ariki anō hoki.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nā, ki te mea kua waiho ahau hei hoa mōu, manako mai ki a ia me te mea ko ahau. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ki te mea ia kua hē ia ki tētahi mea āu, kei a ia rānei tētahi mea āu, waiho mai māku tēnā e whaka­aro. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />He tuhi­tuhi tēnei nāku, nā Paora, nā tōku ringa­ringa ake; māku e whaka­utu. Nā, kāhore āku mea­tanga atu ki a koe, tērā anō tāku taonga kei a koe, ko koe anō. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Āe rā, e tōku teina, kia whai pai ahau i a koe i roto i te Ariki; kia ora tōku ngākau i roto i te Ariki.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />He ū nō tōku whaka­aro ki a koe ka ngohe­ngohe, i tuhi­tuhi atu ai ahau ki a koe, e mōhio ana hoki, tērā e nui atu tāu e mea ai i tāku e kōrero atu nei. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Tēnei anō hoki, kia rite mai i a koe tētahi whare mōku; e mea ana hoki ahau tērā e mana ā koutou īnoi, ā, ka tukua atu ahau ki a koutou.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poroporoaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Tēnei te oha atu nei ki a koe a Epapara, tōku hoa here­here i roto i a Karaiti Īhu, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />rātou tahi ko Māka, ko Aritaku, ko Rīmaha, ko Ruka, ōku hoa mahi.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Kia tau te aroha noa o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti ki ō koutou wairua. Āmine.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>